  "_about": [
    "Battle rules. Rounds: you gain your AP rate in action points each round (startAP on round 1, at most maxAP), spend them on actions, then end your turn: your minions attack, then the enemy acts.",
    "Damage: attacker Damage x power, then the target may dodge (Evasion - attacker Grip, %), a lethal hit multiplies it by 1 + Lethal% (shrunk by Lethal protection, max 10x), and Armour % cuts it after Perforation. Small random spread.",
    "Exhaustion: spells add (Mana cost x Exhaustion rate / 100). Each point weakens your hero's damage; it falls by recoverPerRound each round and restRecover when you Rest.",
    "Actions are keyed by card number. power scales with the action card's tier (tierPower, rarest first).",
    "Minion stats are their card's Health plus combat stats here, scaled by the minion's tier (minionTierMult)."
